msgstr "Nasgadh gus brabhsair na cobharach a chur gu dol."

#: data/org.gnome.settings-daemon.plugins.media-keys.gschema.xml.in:31
#: data/org.gnome.settings-daemon.plugins.media-keys.gschema.xml.in:184
